# Long Hibernia /faction threads: healers, specs, camps, keeps, raids and late-night talk. New writing;
# places, keeps, monsters and specialization lines come from VERIFIED-NAMES.md and RESEARCH-BRIEF.md.
@kind debate
@realm hib

@topic hib_healer_alt
@levels 25-50
@scene hib_gen_healer_alt
@role B class=Druid
@role C class=Bard
@role D class=Warden
@role E type=Leveler,Socialite
A: {q} rolling a healer alt. druid, bard or warden? | {q} need a hib healer alt, which one would you pick | ok healers of hibernia, convince me
B: druid. biggest heals in the realm and nobody argues | druid, hands down. the heals are why groups survive
C: bard. you heal, you run speed, you mez the add. every group wants you | bard, because a group without speed is a group walking home slowly
D: warden. you can stand in melee and not fold | warden, heal from the front line with a weapon in your hand
B: a warden heals ok but nobody asks a warden to main heal a hard camp | main healing spraggon den as a warden sounds like a long night
D: i main healed muire tomb on my warden for a week, nobody died | we cleared muire tomb with me as the only healer and it went fine
C: muire tomb is not exactly a hard test | muire is where everyone learns, it is gentle
~ 25
E: sorry, which one is the bard, the one with the instrument? | wait, which of you plays music
C: that is us. songs, speed and a lute on my back | yes, the one with the songs. we are hard to miss
E: huh, i thought bards only did the speed at the stables | i only ever see bards running speed near the stablemaster
B: and that is the trap. a bard running speed all fight is not healing | the bard is always busy with something, that is my worry
C: i change songs when the fight starts, the group lives | the speed comes down when the pull lands, it is not hard
?D: half of a warden's job happens before the pull, with the buffs | warden buffs make every heal go further, people forget that
~ 30
A: what about soloing, i log at odd hours | solo matters to me too, my friends are never on when i am
B: some nature in a druid and the pet does the work | druid with a bit of nature solos fine, the pet tanks
D: warden solos best of the three. hit it, heal myself, repeat | warden easily, i swing and heal myself and keep going
C: bard solo is slow, i will give you that one | soloing a bard is painful, no argument there
E: so warden for solo, druid for groups, bard for everyone's legs | sounds like warden alone, druid in groups, bard for speed
B: or roll a druid and never solo again, you will be invited everywhere | or play a druid and make friends, problem solved
~ 20
A: leaning druid now honestly | ok, druid it is. probably
C: you will be begging a bard for speed by 20 | fine, but when you need speed you know where to find me
D: and a warden when you want to hit something | call a warden when you get tired of standing in the back
?E: name it something pretty, druids deserve pretty names | gz on the alt in advance
A: thanks all, off to mag mell | appreciate it, see you in lough derg in a few days

@topic hib_bard_everything
@levels 20-50
@scene hib_gen_bard_everything
@role B class=Bard
@role C type=NoLifer
@role D type=Leveler
@role E type=Socialite
A: is it just me or does every hib lfg start with "need bard" | why does every group in hibernia want a bard before anything else
B: because we are the best class in the realm, obviously | because without me you walk. slowly. everywhere
C: speed to camp, mez the add, heal the slip. a bard covers more jobs than anyone | bards do four jobs, that is why they get the first invite
B: and i get yelled at for every one of those jobs | i take that as a compliment, mostly
D: my last group had no bard and the run back from the bind took forever | we tried a group without a bard once. never again
~ 20
B: the part nobody sees is the mez. three adds locked down and nobody notices | people thank the druid and forget who mezzed the adds
C: oh we notice when the mez breaks | people notice. they notice when it breaks
B: it breaks because the hero swings at the mezzed one | it breaks because somebody pbaes right next to it, every time
?E: the eternal mez breaker question returns | lol, it is always the enchanter
D: we had an enchanter break mez four pulls in a row at spraggon den | spraggon den last week, the enchanter woke the adds every single pull
~ 35
E: so do i list a bard as a healer or as support when i lfg | real question, is the bard a healer or a support class
B: support that can heal. if i am the only healer something went wrong | support with heals. do not make me main heal anything big
C: at low levels a bard main heals just fine | i have seen a bard main heal muire tomb without a single death
D: low levels, sure. in the 40s you want a druid behind that bard | in the 40s you need a druid next to the bard, period
C: two bards in one group is silly but so fast | double bard groups are my favorite, everything runs
B: with two bards i finally get to swing a sword | two bards means one plays speed and i get to hit things
A: wait, bards can melee? | i did not know bards could hit things
B: badly. but yes | a blade and a prayer, yes
?C: bard melee is mostly for show | the swinging is decoration, the songs are the class
~ 25
D: ok speaking of bards, we need one for spraggon den right now, 3 spots | lf bard for spraggon den, we have room
B: lol, on my way, send the invite | heh. inv me, i will bring speed
C: and that is how every bard argument ends, with an invite | every bard debate ends with someone needing a bard
?E: have fun, keep an eye on the enchanter | watch out for the mez breakers

@topic hib_mentalist
@levels 20-50
@scene hib_gen_mentalist_identity
@role B class=Mentalist
@role C type=NoLifer
@role D class=Druid
@role E type=Leveler
A: honest question, what is a mentalist for | what does a mentalist do in a group? i see them lfg for ages
B: heals, mez and damage, in any order you like | a bit of everything. heal, mez, hit things with my mind
C: a bit of everything is the problem. three jobs at half strength | jack of all trades. the heals are smaller, the damage is smaller
B: half strength mez is still a mez | my mez holds the add the same as anyone else's
D: mentalist heals saved me more than once at muire tomb | as a druid i like a mentalist next to me, they catch what i miss
C: backup healer, sure. main heals, no | second healer fine. only healer, i get nervous
~ 25
E: sorry to jump in, which line has the heals, light or mana? | newbie question, which spec line heals on a mentalist
B: mentalism. heals and mez live there, light and mana are damage | mentalism has the heals and the mez, the other two hit things
E: so one damage line plus mentalism? | ty, so pick light or mana and put the rest in mentalism
B: that is the usual, yes. some go nearly pure mentalism | most do, yes
?C: and some go all damage and then cannot heal a scratch | and some forget mentalism and wonder why groups pass them over
~ 30
D: for me the mez alone is worth the slot | honestly the mez is the real reason to bring one
C: bards mez too and they bring speed | we already have bards for mez
B: and when the bard is busy keeping speed up, who mezzes the second add | two mezzers is never too many on a big pull
D: true, a second mez saved our spraggon den group last night | had a pull last week where both mezzers were needed
C: fine. a mentalist is welcome. still pick a druid first | i will grant it, mentalists are useful. second pick
?A: so the utility caster of hibernia | the realm's swiss army knife then
~ 20
B: anyway, lfg {level} mentalist, heals mez damage, whatever you need | so... lfg {level} mentalist, can do everything apparently
D: hmm. inv coming, we are short a mezzer | pst you, our group needs a mez
C: and there goes my whole argument | lol fine, go mez something
E: gl in there | have fun

@topic hib_eldritch_spec
