B: fine, void gets groups, i will take it | that is the most reasonable thing said in faction tonight
~ 40
A: ok, void it is. now where is the trainer in tir na nog | going void. wish me luck finding the trainer in tir na nog
?D: up the stairs, past the merchant, then you are lost | nobody knows, that is the secret of tir na nog
E: gl with it, show us some big numbers | gl, post your first big hit

